su name translation_curated_glosses be map def
su text "format" ob text "curated-gloss-v1" ya
su text "scope" ob text "English glosses for atoms whose concept WordNet does not index. These are interim definitions, not WordNet senses: the logical connectives have no WordNet entries at all, so a linked exact sense is impossible and a plain English gloss stands in until a compositional Pyash definition is authored." ya
su text "wa" ob text "logical conjunction: the result is true only when both operands are true" ya
su text "ba" ob text "logical disjunction: the result is true when at least one operand is true" ya
su text "hkit" ob text "exclusive disjunction: the result is true when the operands differ and false when they agree" ya
su text "hwan" ob text "the English conjunction and; joins two noun phrases rather than combining truth values" ya
su text "bluh" ob text "the boolean type marker; a value is either true or false" ya
su text "sr6h" ob text "a noun class whose members are abstract concepts rather than physical things" ya
su text "dyah" ob text "a mood warning the hearer against something, expressing that the action is to be avoided" ya
su text "k6" ob text "agreement that marks a verb for the social rank or gender of the addressee rather than for an argument" ya
su text "qyih" ob text "a noun class whose members are living beings" ya
su text "nrih" ob text "a noun class whose members are human beings" ya
su text "y6" ob text "a noun class whose members are works of art and creative products" ya
su text "swuh" ob text "a mood presenting the statement as an assumption the speaker takes for granted" ya
su text "greh" ob text "a case marking the thing around which the predicate's other participants are arranged" ya
su text "kcuh" ob text "a noun class marking a selection made among alternatives" ya
su text "gxih" ob text "a noun class containing both masculine and feminine nouns, distinguished only by agreement" ya
su text "ta2" ob text "an aspect continuing an action already under way from a prior situation" ya
su text "cyih" ob text "a mood posing a question the speaker is reasoning through rather than asking the hearer" ya
su text "dweh" ob text "an aspect marking an action as lasting only briefly or as bounded to a short stretch" ya
su text "tu" ob text "a mood expressing obligation or permission rather than fact" ya
su text "ma" ob text "a case marking the place or thing toward which motion proceeds" ya
su text "twuh" ob text "a mood presenting the statement as uncertain or doubted" ya
su text "si" ob text "a mood marking the speaker's degree of confidence in the statement's truth" ya
su text "ji" ob text "a noun class whose members take feminine agreement" ya
su text "fyih" ob text "a number stored as a sign, a significand, and an exponent, so it can represent a wide range of magnitudes at limited precision" ya
su text "gjih" ob text "a noun class whose members are galaxies" ya
su text "tleh" ob text "a tense placing the event on the day before the day of speaking" ya
su text "nri7h" ob text "a noun class whose members are non-living things" ya
su text "kcu7h" ob text "a mood presenting a conclusion drawn from particular observations rather than stated as fact" ya
su text "nyeh" ob text "a case marking the participant who initiates an action, distinct from the one who completes it" ya
su text "bjeh" ob text "a noun class whose members are places and locations" ya
su text "te" ob text "a case marking the place where the action occurs" ya
su text "ta7" ob text "a case marking motion with respect to a place, combining location with direction" ya
su text "pyah" ob text "a noun class whose members are affections and bonds of attachment" ya
su text "ne" ob text "a noun class whose members take masculine agreement" ya
su text "vlih" ob text "a noun class whose members are minerals and stone" ya
su text "gvih" ob text "a case marking the recipient in a clause whose verb assigns a thing to that recipient" ya
su text "pi2" ob text "a noun class whose members are planets" ya
su text "dzih" ob text "a case marking the thing possessed rather than its possessor" ya
su text "cloh" ob text "a noun class whose members are beings capable of reason" ya
su text "cleh" ob text "a tense placing the event in the immediate past, earlier on the day of speaking" ya
su text "tli7h" ob text "a tense placing the event in the distant future, beyond the near future" ya
su text "dxah" ob text "a tense placing the event in the distant past, before the remembered past" ya
su text "nwuh" ob text "a noun class whose members are inquiries and studies" ya
su text "tyih" ob text "an aspect viewing a situation from the standpoint of its aftermath" ya
su text "n6" ob text "a mood marking the statement as based on the speaker's own sensory observation" ya
su text "gweh" ob text "a tense placing the event in the immediate future, later on the day of speaking" ya
su text "so" ob text "a case marking the place or thing from which motion proceeds" ya
su text "lu" ob text "a mood presenting the statement as a guess about what may or will be the case" ya
su text "qe" ob text "a noun class whose members are stars" ya
su text "ta" ob text "a case marking the clause's topic, the thing the statement is about" ya
su text "bxih" ob text "a noun class whose members are universes" ya
su text "sleh" ob text "a noun class whose members are plants" ya
su text "xleh" ob text "a noun class whose members are vehicles" ya
su text "we" ob text "a case marking the route along which motion proceeds" ya
su text "ga" ob text "a case marking the path a motion follows, synonymous with the vialis" ya
su text "bwih" ob text "a noun class whose members are wisdom and sound judgement" ya
su text "zo" ob text "a noun class whose members are animals" ya
su text "da" ob text "a case expressed by an adposition, whether preposition or postposition" ya
su text "t6" ob text "a mood affirming that the proposition holds, as opposed to negating it" ya
su text "je" ob text "a case marking the participant who performs the action" ya
su text "pyi7h" ob text "a voice promoting an oblique participant to a core argument role" ya
su text "pceh" ob text "a mood expressing fear that the event may occur" ya
su text "lyeh" ob text "an aspect presenting the action as having no inherent endpoint" ya
su text "byih" ob text "a mood expressing a blessing or good wish" ya
su text "pwah" ob text "a case marking the participant for whose benefit the action occurs" ya
su text "ksih" ob text "a case marking the cause or reason for the action" ya
su text "qa" ob text "an aspect marking the cessation of an action" ya
su text "mweh" ob text "an aspect presenting the action as carried through to completion" ya
su text "s6" ob text "a tense placing the event on the day after the day of speaking" ya
su text "dwih" ob text "a mood expressing a desire for the event" ya
su text "di" ob text "a mood directing the hearer to act" ya
su text "nwoh" ob text "a mood presenting the event as actually occurring rather than as possible or wished" ya
su text "nwah" ob text "a case marking the source of the speaker's information" ya
su text "kweh" ob text "a first-person plural form that excludes the person addressed" ya
su text "zreh" ob text "a case whose meaning is not derived from any single component of the construction" ya
su text "go" ob text "an aspect presenting a statement as generally true rather than tied to a particular occasion" ya
su text "gyih" ob text "a mood presenting a statement as a general truth" ya
su text "vrih" ob text "a tense used for narrating past events, typical of chronicle style" ya
su text "pruh" ob text "a mood expressing a curse or malediction" ya
su text "za" ob text "an aspect marking the beginning of an action or state" ya
su text "mo" ob text "a first-person plural form that includes the person addressed" ya
su text "ri" ob text "a mood marking the clause as a question" ya
su text "jwih" ob text "a mood expressing a command directed at a third person rather than the hearer" ya
su text "lwoh" ob text "a case marking the place where the action occurs" ya
su text "mreh" ob text "an aspect presenting the action as a single brief instant" ya
su text "tl6h" ob text "a number marking a large quantity, contrasted with the paucal" ya
su text "si2" ob text "a mood expressing that the event must occur" ya
su text "psih" ob text "a mood expressing a wish for the event to occur" ya
su text "xwih" ob text "a case marking the participant affected by the action" ya
su text "po" ob text "a number marking a small countable quantity, more than a few but fewer than many" ya
su text "mwih" ob text "a mood granting permission for the event" ya
su text "pu" ob text "a number marking more than one referent" ya
su text "tsi2h" ob text "a case expressed by a postposition rather than by inflection" ya
su text "rwih" ob text "a mood expressing a request or entreaty" ya
su text "ru" ob text "a mood forbidding the event, the negative counterpart of the imperative" ya
su text "pi7" ob text "a mood proposing a course of action for the group to take" ya
su text "rwah" ob text "an aspect presenting the event as about to happen" ya
su text "twoh" ob text "a case marking the material being quoted or reported" ya
su text "gluh" ob text "a number marking one member singled out of a collective or mass" ya
su text "si7" ob text "a case marking the thing compared against in a superlative construction" ya
su text "tfeh" ob text "an aspect presenting the action as directed toward a goal or endpoint" ya
su text "kxeh" ob text "a case marking the destination or goal of motion" ya
su text "lo" ob text "a mood expressing the speaker's will that the event occur" ya
su text "ksuh" ob text "a mood presenting the clause as a statement of fact" ya
su text "tcih" ob text "a mood encouraging the hearer to act, weaker than a command" ya
su text "lwah" ob text "a case marking the path across or through which motion proceeds" ya
su text "sri7h" ob text "a voice marking that two participants act on each other" ya
su text "fyoh" ob text "a voice marking that the agent acts on itself" ya
prah
